body=hero('Release readiness','Know what changed.<br>Know what still needs proof.','Map applicable release changes to business rules and scoped verification. Keep missing coverage visible before the release decision.',button('Read the readiness guide','guide-release-readiness.html')+button('Review integration checks','guide-integrations.html',True))
body+=section('<h2>Three questions before a release</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Does it apply?</h3><p>Check official advisories against the intended org. Record sources and unknowns.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>What can it affect?</h3><p>Trace known dependencies to business rules, personas and connected systems.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>What proves readiness?</h3><p>Review current assertions in the correct environment, including failures and blocked checks.</p></article></div>')
body+=section('<div class="notice"><strong>A concrete integration deadline:</strong> Salesforce lists February 20, 2027 for retirement of the OAuth username-password flow. Applicability depends on the integrations actually using it. <a href="https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=005461279&amp;language=en_US&amp;type=1">Official notice</a>, checked November 14, 2026.</div><h2>Build a reviewable evidence pack</h2><p>Include the advisory or proposed change, affected rules, environment bindings, selected test results, unresolved gaps, owners and next actions. An old successful run or a different sandbox is not current readiness evidence.</p>'+button('Start with your scope','../../examples/salesforce/onboarding.csv'))
