body=hero('Implementation acceptance','Agree what to build.<br>Verify what was delivered.','Give business owners, implementation partners and verification teams a shared rule and evidence trail. Use one journey to establish the pattern.',button('Read implementation guidance','../../docs/salesforce/implementation.md')+button('Prepare one scenario','guide-adapt-assets.html',True))
body+=section('<div class="split"><div><h2>Start with intent.</h2><p>A new org cannot explain the process the customer wants. An existing org can reveal configuration, but it cannot decide whether that behavior is intended, legacy or a bug.</p><p>Record the owner’s decision before turning the configuration into an expected result.</p></div><div><h2>Finish with evidence.</h2><p>Map approved requirements to role, boundary and integration checks. Review actual results and retain the link to the rule version.</p><p>Then make that evidence useful as a customer guide and a baseline for future changes.</p></div></div><div class="notice">This starter prepares review drafts. Autonomous configuration deployment, complete cross-system verification and automatic release approval are not shipped by this pack.</div>')
